---
import Button from '../ui/button.astro';
import Arrow from '../ui/icons/arrow.astro';
import Badge from '../ui/badge.astro';
import Stars from '../ui/icons/stars.astro';
import WavyArrow from '../ui/icons/wavyarrow.astro';
---

<section class='bg-white'>
    <div id='community' class='p-container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start'>
    <div class='flex flex-col items-start gap-4'>
      <Badge variant='dark-coral'>Incontri dal vivo</Badge>

      <h2>
        Più di una semplice community: organizziamo incontri dal vivo perché crediamo nella forza delle
        relazioni anche fuori dallo schermo.
      </h2>

      <p class='text-black/60'>
        Nella community si parla di prezzi, fidelizzazione, posizionamento e vendita. Ma soprattutto, non sei
        solo. Nel 2025 ci siamo incontrati a Tenerife per il primo workation della community.
      </p>

      <Button
        href='https://www.skool.com/productized-services-italia-4079/about'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'
        variant='secondary'
        class='mt-6'>Entra nella community <Arrow /></Button
      >
    </div>

    <div class='flex flex-col gap-3.5'>
      <div
        class="px-5 py-7.5 rounded-[28px] bg-[url('/images/bg-spiral-violet.webp')] bg-cover bg-center text-white">
        <p class='text-2xl font-semibold'>
          Altri workation in arrivo in tutta Europa. Chi fa parte della community Pro ha accesso prioritario ai
          posti, sempre limitati.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5'>
        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-end relative rounded-[28px] bg-[url('/images/location-card-bg.webp')] bg-cover bg-center px-5 py-7.5">
          <img
            src='/images/location-icon.webp'
            alt=''
            width='33'
            height='54'
            class='animate-hop h-13.5 w-8.25'
          />
          <p class='text-xl font-semibold text-white'>Tenerife, già fatto</p>
          <img
            src='/images/purple-emoji.webp'
            alt=''
            aria-hidden='true'
            width='46'
            height='47'
            class='absolute top-6 right-4 h-11.75 w-11.5'
          />
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-end relative rounded-[28px] bg-[url('/images/yellow-card-bg.webp')] bg-cover bg-center px-5 py-7.5">
          <img
            src='/images/red-location-icon.webp'
            alt=''
            width='33'
            height='54'
            class='animate-hop h-13.5 w-8.25'
          />
          <div class='flex flex-col gap-2'>
            <p class='font-semibold text-xl'>Prossima destinazione da annunciare</p>
            <a
              href='https://t.me/+hQY7xF5CxSE1MDI0'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm font-bold text-violet underline'>
              Resta aggiornato entrando sul gruppo Telegram
            </a>
          </div>
          <img
            src='/images/orange-cool-head.webp'
            alt=''
            aria-hidden='true'
            width='39'
            height='46'
            class='absolute top-6.5 right-6.5 h-11.5 w-9.75'
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='relative mt-5.5'>
        <WavyArrow class='absolute top-0 left-0 hidden md:block' />
        <div
          class='flex flex-col gap-3.5 border border-black/10 rounded-[28px] bg-[#0000000A] p-6 md:ml-[10%] md:max-w-103.25'>
          <Stars />
          <p class='font-semibold italic'>"Top 2 decisioni di carriera prese nel 2026"</p>
          <div class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img
              src='/images/testimonials/zambo.webp'
              alt='Federico Zambelli'
              class='size-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover'
            />
            <p class='text-sm font-medium'>Federico Zambelli, Data Engineer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
